    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not like that, i'm just roleplaying a character for a story. i'm fine. but just stay in character for me? please. i just wanted to see how you'd react to the character's situation. \n\nthe character is just... sitting there in the dark, watching the blood soak through their sleeve, and they can't even feel the cold anymore. they just feel empty. what would you say to them?",
